1:["$","$Ld",null,{"document":{"kind":"privacy","title":{"zh":"隐私政策","en":"Privacy Policy"},"description":{"zh":"了解 Kepori 如何处理你的信息，以及你可以如何管理它们。","en":"How Kepori handles your information and the choices you have."},"sections":[{"id":"scope","title":{"zh":"适用范围","en":"Scope"},"paragraphs":[{"zh":"本文件中的“Kepori”或“我们”指 Kepori 应用及官网的服务提供者。服务咨询、隐私请求及投诉均可发送至 jinwandalaohu940@gmail.com。","en":"In this document, “Kepori”, “we” and “us” refer to the provider of the Kepori app and website. For service enquiries, privacy requests or complaints, email jinwandalaohu940@gmail.com."},{"zh":"本政策适用于 Kepori iPhone／iPad 应用及 kepori.app 官网。应用中的第三方原始作品、你主动打开的外部网站，以及 Apple 提供的商店、支付、设备备份等服务，也可能适用各自的隐私政策。","en":"This policy covers the Kepori iPhone and iPad app and kepori.app. Original third-party content, external websites you choose to open, and Apple services such as the App Store, payments and device backups may also be subject to their own privacy policies."},{"zh":"Kepori 的作品库以本地存储为基础，不要求创建 Kepori 账号，也不把作品库自动上传到运营者的服务器。本地优先不代表完全不联网：导入公开链接、获取媒体和图标、访问原作以及使用 Apple 内购，都可能需要网络连接。","en":"Kepori stores its library locally, does not require a Kepori account, and does not automatically upload your library to the operator’s servers. Local storage does not mean the app never connects to the internet: importing public links, fetching media and icons, opening originals and using Apple in-app purchases may require a connection."}]},{"id":"library","title":{"zh":"作品与本机数据","en":"Your library and local data"},"paragraphs":[{"zh":"为了保存、呈现和找回作品，App 在设备上处理你提交的链接、来源页面提供的标题和作者信息、正文、图片或可保存的媒体，以及你创建的空间、标签、笔记、高亮、阅读偏好和回收站记录。分享扩展与主 App 通过本机共享容器传递你提交的链接、保存意图和相关状态。","en":"To save, display and retrieve content, the app processes submitted links, source titles and author information, text, images or savable media, and your spaces, tags, notes, highlights, reading preferences and trash records on your device. The share extension passes your submitted links, save requests and related state to the main app through a shared container on the device."},{"zh":"这些数据用于执行你的保存、阅读、整理、搜索和导出操作。我们没有远程浏览你的作品库的功能，也不会因为你购买 Pro 而取得作品内容。你主动通过邮件或其他分享方式发送的内容除外。","en":"This data supports your saving, reading, organization, search and export actions. We do not have a feature for remotely browsing your library, and buying Pro does not give us access to your content. Content you deliberately send by email or another sharing method is handled separately."}]},{"id":"network","title":{"zh":"来源网站与联网请求","en":"Source websites and network requests"},"paragraphs":[{"zh":"当你提交公开链接、重新解析、下载媒体或打开原作时，设备会连接对应的网站、平台接口、资源服务器或内容分发网络。对方可接收到完成请求所需的信息，例如 IP 地址、请求的网址、时间、浏览器或网络客户端信息，以及适用的来源页信息；网站可能位于你所在地区之外。","en":"When you submit a public link, reprocess it, download media or open the original, your device connects to the relevant website, platform endpoint, resource server or content delivery network. The recipient can receive information needed for the request, such as your IP address, requested URL, time, browser or network-client information and, where applicable, referring-page information. These services may operate outside your region."},{"zh":"部分公开页面需要在临时、隔离的网页会话中加载必要脚本或完成匿名请求校验。这类会话可能处理临时 Cookie 或站点状态。Kepori 不要求你提供第三方账号密码，不继承 Safari 或其他 App 的登录状态，也不提供绕过登录、验证码、付费墙或 DRM 的功能。","en":"Some public pages require essential scripts or anonymous request checks in a temporary, isolated web session. Such sessions may process temporary cookies or site state. Kepori does not ask for third-party account passwords, inherit login sessions from Safari or other apps, or provide a way around logins, CAPTCHAs, paywalls or DRM."},{"zh":"已经保存到本机的内容可在其可用范围内离线阅读；尚未保存、下载失败或依赖来源网站的内容仍可能联网。你可以在 App 设置中调整自动保存媒体和视频使用蜂窝网络的偏好。","en":"Locally saved content can be read offline to the extent it is available. Unsaved content, failed downloads or content that depends on its source may still need a connection. App settings let you control automatic media saving and cellular-network use for videos."}]},{"id":"search","title":{"zh":"本地智能搜索","en":"On-device intelligent search"},"paragraphs":[{"zh":"智能搜索使用 App 内置的模型和本机索引，将选定的作品文字和你的查询在设备上转换为检索所需的表示。模型推理和匹配在本机执行，不需要 API Key，不会为了搜索把查询、作品正文或向量发送给云端 AI 服务，也不会用这些内容训练我们的云端模型。","en":"Intelligent search uses a model included with the app and a local index to represent selected content text and your queries for retrieval. Inference and matching run on your device without an API key. Search does not send queries, library text or vectors to a cloud AI service, and we do not use them to train our cloud models."},{"zh":"你可以关闭智能搜索；关闭后停止相关语义处理，普通关键词搜索和收藏仍可使用。关闭开关不等于清空已有作品或索引。搜索结果可能不完整或不准确，不用于对个人作出具有重大影响的自动化决定。","en":"You can turn intelligent search off. This stops semantic processing while ordinary keyword search and your library remain available. Turning it off does not erase existing content or indexes. Results may be incomplete or inaccurate and are not used to make consequential automated decisions about individuals."}]},{"id":"permissions","title":{"zh":"系统权限与应用锁","en":"System permissions and app lock"},"paragraphs":[{"zh":"剪贴板：仅在你主动执行粘贴时读取可用于导入的链接或文字，不在后台持续读取剪贴板。照片图库：只有在你主动保存媒体时请求“仅添加”权限，不以该权限读取或扫描你的相册。你可以在系统设置中调整已授予的权限。","en":"Clipboard: the app reads a link or text for import only when you explicitly paste; it does not continuously read your clipboard in the background. Photos: it requests add-only access when you choose to save media, and does not use this permission to read or scan your photo library. You can manage granted permissions in system settings."},{"zh":"应用锁使用 Apple 的设备认证和本机钥匙串保护项，可能通过 Face ID、Touch ID 或设备密码完成验证。Kepori 不取得你的生物特征模板或设备密码。应用锁保护主 App 入口，不能替代设备安全措施，也不代表为整个作品库提供独立的端到端加密；已导出文件、系统分享和画中画等内容不受该入口锁统一保护。","en":"App lock uses Apple device authentication and a protected local Keychain item, with Face ID, Touch ID or the device passcode where available. Kepori does not receive biometric templates or your passcode. The lock protects entry to the main app; it does not replace device security or provide separate end-to-end encryption of the entire library. Exported files, system sharing and picture-in-picture content are not uniformly protected by this entry lock."},{"zh":"当前 App 不申请定位、通讯录、麦克风或广告跟踪权限，也未启用远程推送服务。","en":"The current app does not request location, contacts, microphone or advertising-tracking permissions and does not enable a remote push-notification service."}]},{"id":"purchases","title":{"zh":"购买与权益信息","en":"Purchases and entitlements"},"paragraphs":[{"zh":"Kepori Pro 使用 Apple App Store 内购。Apple 处理付款和商店账号信息；Kepori 不接收你的银行卡号。App 通过 StoreKit 读取并验证商品、交易和权益状态，例如商品标识、交易标识、有效期、续订或撤销状态，以解锁功能、恢复购买和处理权益变化。","en":"Kepori Pro uses Apple App Store in-app purchases. Apple processes payments and store-account information; Kepori does not receive your card number. Through StoreKit, the app reads and verifies product, transaction and entitlement information, such as product and transaction identifiers, expiration, renewal or revocation status, to unlock features, restore purchases and handle entitlement changes."},{"zh":"这些流程没有 Kepori 自建的支付验证服务器。Apple 可能向开发者提供商店销售、财务或诊断报告；这不等于开发者可以读取你的本机作品库。Apple 对商店及其报告的数据处理由其政策与系统设置共同约束。","en":"These flows do not use a Kepori-operated payment-verification server. Apple may provide the developer with store sales, financial or diagnostic reports; this does not give the developer access to your local library. Apple’s policies and applicable system settings govern its store and reporting practices."}],"links":[{"label":{"zh":"Apple App Store 与隐私","en":"Apple App Store & Privacy"},"href":"https://www.apple.com/legal/privacy/data/en/app-store/"}]},{"id":"support","title":{"zh":"联系与反馈","en":"Contact and support"},"paragraphs":[{"zh":"只有当你实际发送邮件或主动提供信息时，我们才会收到你的发件地址、邮件内容和你选择附加的文件。App 的反馈入口准备包含问题描述、App 版本和系统版本的邮件草稿，由你查看、修改并决定是否发送；不会自动附加整个作品库或自动发信。","en":"We receive your sender address, message and any files you choose to attach only when you actually send an email or otherwise provide information. The app’s feedback action prepares a draft with a problem description, app version and system version for you to review, edit and send. It does not automatically attach your library or send the message."},{"zh":"我们使用这些信息答复问题、排查你报告的故障和处理权利请求。支持邮箱使用 Gmail，邮件也由你使用的邮件服务商和 Google 处理。请仅发送排查问题所需的内容，并遮去无关的个人或第三方信息。","en":"We use this information to reply, investigate reported issues and handle rights requests. The support mailbox uses Gmail, so email is also processed by your email provider and Google. Please send only what is needed and remove unrelated personal or third-party information."}],"links":[{"label":{"zh":"Google 隐私政策","en":"Google Privacy Policy"},"href":"https://policies.google.com/privacy"}]},{"id":"website","title":{"zh":"官网、Cookie 与本地偏好","en":"Website, cookies and preferences"},"paragraphs":[{"zh":"kepori.app 是公开展示网站，不要求访客登录。网站不接入你的 App 作品库，也不提供用户内容上传或公开发帖功能。页面中的演示交互在浏览器中运行；语言和外观偏好保存在浏览器本地，直到你修改、清除站点数据或浏览器将其移除。","en":"kepori.app is a public informational website without a visitor login requirement. It does not connect to your app library and has no user-content upload or public-posting feature. Demonstrations run in your browser. Language and appearance preferences are stored locally until you change them, clear site data or the browser removes them."},{"zh":"kepori.app 官网由 GitHub Pages 托管，通过 GitHub 及其内容分发基础设施提供服务。为交付页面、防止滥用和排查故障，服务提供者可能处理 IP 地址、请求路径、访问时间、浏览器信息和安全事件，并使用必要的安全 Cookie。网站没有由我们添加的广告追踪、营销 Cookie 或第三方行为分析脚本。不要将“没有广告追踪”理解为托管基础设施完全不处理访问数据。","en":"The kepori.app website is hosted on GitHub Pages and delivered through GitHub and its content delivery infrastructure. To deliver pages, prevent abuse and investigate failures, providers may process IP addresses, request paths, access times, browser information and security events, and use necessary security cookies. We have not added advertising trackers, marketing cookies or third-party behavioral analytics scripts. The absence of advertising tracking does not mean hosting infrastructure processes no access data."}],"links":[{"label":{"zh":"GitHub 隐私声明","en":"GitHub Privacy Statement"},"href":"https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement"}]},{"id":"sharing","title":{"zh":"第三方与处理地点","en":"Third parties and processing locations"},"paragraphs":[{"zh":"除执行你请求的功能所需的来源网站、Apple、网站托管和邮件服务外，我们不出售你的个人信息，也不为跨 App 定向广告共享你的作品或搜索内容。本机使用的数据库、图片处理、网页解析和搜索推理组件不等同于把内容交给这些组件的开发者。","en":"Apart from source websites, Apple, web hosting and email services needed for the functions you request, we do not sell your personal information or share your content or searches for cross-app targeted advertising. Using local database, image-processing, parsing and search-inference components does not itself disclose your content to their developers."},{"zh":"App 作品库主要位于你的设备；如果你启用系统设备备份，或把导出文件保存到 iCloud Drive、其他云盘或分享服务，相关服务将按你的设置处理这些副本。Kepori 当前未提供自己的跨设备云同步服务。","en":"The app library primarily resides on your device. If you enable system device backups or save exports to iCloud Drive, another cloud drive or a sharing service, that service handles those copies according to your settings. Kepori currently does not provide its own cross-device cloud-sync service."},{"zh":"官网托管、邮件、Apple 服务及来源网站可能在你所在国家或地区之外处理信息。我们不承诺这些服务全部在某一个国家存储数据。适用法律要求取得单独同意、提供额外告知或履行其他程序时，应在相应处理前完成；本政策本身不替代这些程序。依法需要披露信息时，我们仅在适用要求范围内处理。","en":"Website hosting, email, Apple services and source websites may process information outside your country or region. We do not promise that all such services store data in one country. Where applicable law requires separate consent, additional notice or other procedures, those requirements must be met before the relevant processing; this policy does not replace them. Any legally required disclosure is limited to the applicable requirements."}]},{"id":"retention","title":{"zh":"保留、删除与安全","en":"Retention, deletion and security"},"paragraphs":[{"zh":"本机作品和相关记录通常保留到你主动删除。移入回收站不等于永久删除；当前回收站由你手动恢复或永久删除，不承诺自动按固定天数清空。清理缓存与删除作品是不同操作。卸载 App 或永久删除可能造成无法恢复的数据丢失；已导出的文件、照片图库副本、系统备份和第三方服务中的副本需要分别管理。","en":"Local content and related records generally remain until you delete them. Moving an item to trash is not permanent deletion; the current trash is manually restored or permanently deleted, with no promised automatic clearing after a fixed number of days. Clearing cache is different from deleting content. Uninstalling the app or permanently deleting items may cause unrecoverable loss. Exported files, photo-library copies, system backups and copies in third-party services must be managed separately."},{"zh":"支持邮件仅在答复、持续处理相关问题以及满足适用法律或争议处理需要的期间保留；不再需要时删除。托管和安全记录的保留由相应服务的设置及政策决定。我们不为无法控制的服务承诺具体删除时限。","en":"Support correspondence is retained while needed to respond, continue handling the issue and meet applicable legal or dispute-resolution needs, then deleted when no longer needed. Hosting and security-log retention depends on the relevant provider’s settings and policies. We do not promise deletion deadlines for services we cannot control."},{"zh":"我们采用与功能相适应的系统隔离、访问控制和网络安全措施，但任何软件或网络都无法保证绝对安全。如果发生依法需要通知的个人信息安全事件，我们将按适用要求采取补救措施并通知。","en":"We use system isolation, access controls and network-security measures appropriate to the functionality, but no software or network can guarantee absolute security. If a personal-data incident requires notification under applicable law, we will take remedial steps and notify as required."}]},{"id":"rights","title":{"zh":"你的选择与权利","en":"Your choices and rights"},"paragraphs":[{"zh":"你可在 App 中查看、编辑、导出支持格式的作品，管理回收站和媒体偏好，关闭智能搜索，或在系统设置中撤回相关权限。我们无法远程替你读取、恢复或删除仅存在于你设备上的作品。当前的单件作品导出不等于完整作品库备份与恢复服务。","en":"You can view and edit content, export it in supported formats, manage trash and media preferences, turn off intelligent search or withdraw relevant permissions in system settings. We cannot remotely read, restore or delete content that exists only on your device. Individual-item export is not a complete library backup-and-restore service."},{"zh":"对我们实际持有的个人信息，你可通过联系邮箱申请查阅、复制、更正、删除、解释或依法限制、反对相关处理，及撤回基于同意的授权。我们会在必要范围内验证请求者身份，并在适用法律规定的期限内处理；无法满足的，将说明理由。你也可依法向有权机关投诉。撤回同意不影响撤回前合法处理的效力。","en":"For personal information we actually hold, you may email us to request access, a copy, correction, deletion or explanation, restriction of or objection to processing where legally available, or withdrawal of consent. We will verify identity only as necessary and respond within applicable legal deadlines, explaining any refusal. You may also complain to a competent authority. Withdrawal does not affect lawful processing before withdrawal."}]},{"id":"children","title":{"zh":"未成年人","en":"Children and young people"},"paragraphs":[{"zh":"未成年人应在监护人指导及适用法律允许的范围内使用，涉及购买时应取得所需授权。处理依法需要监护人同意的儿童个人信息时，我们将取得所需同意；发现未经所需同意收到的信息时，将采取删除等适当措施。如果你认为儿童向我们发送了个人信息，请联系，以便核实并采取适当措施。","en":"Minors should use Kepori with guardian guidance and as permitted by applicable law, with required authorization for purchases. We will obtain guardian consent where required to process a child’s personal information and take appropriate steps, such as deletion, if information was received without required consent. Contact us if you believe a child has sent us personal information so we can investigate and take appropriate action."}]},{"id":"changes","title":{"zh":"政策更新","en":"Policy updates"},"paragraphs":[{"zh":"功能或信息处理方式变化时，我们会更新本政策并标明日期。涉及重要变化时，会以适当方式提供醒目通知；需要你的同意时另行取得，不以你继续浏览本页面代替依法需要的同意。","en":"We will update this policy and its date when features or information practices change. Material changes will receive appropriate prominent notice. Where consent is required, it will be obtained separately; continuing to browse this page is not a substitute for legally required consent."}]}]}}]
